OL,3,GNEWSAEnvironment bosses want more
OL,4,Afunding to cut weeds
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's Environment Committee has
OL,7,Fapplied for more money to deal with
OL,8,Fweeds on the roadside in 2027.
OL,10,FEnvironment and Infrastructure
OL,11,FCommittee (E&I) President Adrian
OL,12,FGabriel said the money would be used to
OL,13,Femploy more people to maintain the
OL,14,Froads, as, in his words, the current
OL,15,Fapproach "wasn't working".
OL,17,FThe committee has been criticised for
OL,18,Fletting island roads become unkempt,
OL,19,Fwith some parish officials saying the
OL,20,FStates should return to using
OL,21,Fweedkiller glyphosate to maintain them.
OL,23,APub: 09-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
